{"reviews":[{"id":"B08YN59SQG-0","r":5.0,"t":"love it","x":"I loved how it glides on and lasts. Love the double feature of liquid liner on one end and gel liner on the other! Also, the brow razor trimming tool was a bonus\ud83d\ude0a","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-1","r":5.0,"t":"Double Eyeliner Pen","x":"I'm very happy with the quality and price of this product. I will definitely be buying this eye liner again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-2","r":5.0,"t":"Love this pen! 2 different liners in 1 & actually works great!","x":"The liquid felt tip eyeliner went on super smooth and actually didn\u2019t smudge even after I rubbed my eyes on accident a couple times it stayed on all day! & the pencil on the other end of the pen I really loved! I usually have problems with pencil liners smudging especially after a couple hours and have that corner buildup and smudge but I didn\u2019t get that with this one. Hoping it continues to work this good lol. Even came with a little eyebrow shaver. Definitely worth the money!!!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great Buy","x":"Great product. Its so convenient having both liquid and gel eyeliner in one stick. Both types work really well for me. It doesn\u2019t clump up like and stays on for a couple of hours. I would have liked it to have the smear tool. But I am definitely purchasing this product again.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-4","r":4.0,"t":"Smooth application, liquid part is good and stays throughout the day, pencil part smudgy.","x":"The liquid eyeliner goes smooth and stays for the whole day, the pencil part is a little smudgy, that's why I take one star off. Not waterproof, but still holds well. Also my eyes are very sensitive to cosmetics,this eyeliner doesn't trigger any reactions.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-5","r":5.0,"t":"amazing affordable and easy to use","x":"I like  that I can use one side for my  wing abd the other side for my water line .. a gel and liquid in one .the lol face razor  was a plus sharp enough to to the job but gentle enough now to knick or hurt","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-6","r":5.0,"t":"This eyeliner is great!!","x":"I am horrible at applying eyeliner. With this eyeliner it was near impossible to goof it up. I tried both sides, gel and liquid, different looks and uses for both, but love them equally. It's like magic!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great Eyeliner!","x":"I think it's fantastic i trimmed my eyebrows up pretty great with the razor and both sides of the eyeliner apply really nicely and smooth. The thickness was wonderful. Simple and easy to use.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-8","r":2.0,"t":"LOVE IT BUT ONLY LASTED A WEEK. (Sniff sniff)","x":"First of all, I LOVE this eyeliner! It is so smooth and easy to apply.  The ONLY reason I gave 2 stars was because after a week, it was all dried up or out. Contacted company but no response.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-9","r":5.0,"t":"Made a great decision to buy this fantastic double eyeliner pen.","x":"Will leave honest awesome review today after work. I love it so far. Have not used the liquid part yet but plan to try it when I get home before friend and myself go to get nails done.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-10","r":4.0,"t":"Long lasting","x":"It is easy to use and it makes my eyes look great. Ive never used a liquid before and i was surprised what a difference it makes. If you like a bolder look this is for you.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-11","r":5.0,"t":"Will continue to buy","x":"Only been using for about a week but I will continue to buy the the liquid eye line doesn't run it's amazing and the gel line stays in place as well and goes on so smoothly","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-12","r":5.0,"t":"Best eyeliner for the price","x":"I love how easily the eyeliner goes on without a mess. It looks like it would be much more expensive than it is. Definitely my favorite eyeliner I have found so far","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-13","r":5.0,"t":"Great eyeliner","x":"done. Your Comment  I really like this eye liner. I like that it has pencil and liquid together, glides on smoothly, and lasts all day. Good product for the price.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-14","r":5.0,"t":"\ud83d\udc4d Great","x":"The felt  tip is very fexilble and precise and works wonderfully, I love this eye liner. Bonous the gel liner included, one less thing to look for.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great product for value!","x":"I absolutely love this liner. It's easy to use and kong lasting. Being double sided makes things much easier as well! Great product for the price.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-16","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent Eyeliner!","x":"I am very pleased with the eyeliner.  It goes on smoothly and stays on all day.  This is my second purchase and I will definitely purchase again!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-17","r":5.0,"t":"Good stuff!","x":"Great quality marker style eyeliner! The point is sharp and makes a good Cat eye! The other side is amazing for smudging in the under eye area!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-18","r":5.0,"t":"Pleasantly surprised","x":"Never really used liquid liner before. This really stayed put. Went on very smooth and even. Looked the same when I got up the next morning","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-19","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing dual eyeliner.","x":"This eyeliner is my absolute go-to now. It's smooth and bright. Liquid one side, gel on the other. Doesn't smudge. Last a very long time.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-20","r":5.0,"t":"Works As Well As Expensive Brands","x":"I love it just as much as my far more expensive brands. Although the tip is a little stiff, it stays on like glue until you take it off","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-21","r":5.0,"t":"It last a long time.","x":"It is awesome vary easy to put on gos on smooth and no running i dont look like a racoon after 2 hours. Last for 12 hours if not more.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great product for the price","x":"This product works really well, and it is really amazing for the price. It lasts almost all day and is a great buy for the price.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-23","r":5.0,"t":"Smooth with no smudges","x":"Exactly what I was looking for.  I needed a good black \u201cmarker like\u201d eye liner that didn\u2019t leak and this fit my needs exactly.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08YN59SQG-24","r":5.0,"t":"Great eyeliner","x":"I love the accuracy of the brow razor and liner. It\u2019s difficult at first for me to apply but definitely a no brained to wear.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"May 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers love the dual-ended design with liquid liner on one side and gel/pencil liner on the other, calling it convenient and a great value.","cites":[1,3,4,6,7,14,15]},{"text":"The liquid eyeliner applies smoothly and lasts all day without smudging.","cites":[3,5,12,14]},{"text":"Many reviewers find it easy to use, even for those who struggle with eyeliner application.","cites":[7,8,11,13]},{"text":"The included brow razor/trimming tool is appreciated as a bonus.","cites":[1,6,8]},{"text":"Some reviewers note the pencil/gel side can be smudgy, and one reports the product dried out after only a week with no company response.","cites":[5,9]}]},"qa":[]}